## 5. Firmware Overview

See [`intercom-signal-generator.ino`](intercom-signal-generator.ino).

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| Output | 800 Hz notes (250 ms) + 120 ms pause, always on after boot |
| Gate timing | `esp_timer` 1 ms |
| OLED UI | `800Hz NOTE` / `250+120ms`, long bar + gap preview |

### Flashing

1. Open `intercom-signal-generator.ino` in Arduino IDE.
2. Board: **ESP32C3 Dev Module**.
3. Install **U8g2** library.
4. Flash via USB.
